        "content": "## Dev harness\nToken-protected test RPC: POST /webhook/dev with { target, input }. Routes to a fixed sub-workflow by target and responds synchronously with that sub-workflow's own result, since the caller needs the result itself, not just an acknowledgment. An unmatched target answers 404.",
