        "height": 560,
        "content": "## Tool targets\nupsert-patient, book-appointment and change-appointment forward straight to their sub-workflows (change-appointment gets blank strings for any field the call leaves out). check-availability does the same. find-patient loads context, looks up the phone by exact match (Always Output Data, so no match still yields one empty item), drops that placeholder, and wraps whatever's left into { rows }, which is [] for a first-time patient. cleanup is handed whole to the dev-cleanup sub-workflow, which deletes a phone prefix's test data from Calendar, Sheets and Postgres.",
